 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Morning. I'd like to review my blood pressure tablets. My GP mentioned I should go through them."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Happy to. Tell me exactly what you take."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 10 mg, once a day. Ramipril, 10 mg, once a day. And indapamide, 1.5 mg, in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you take all of them every day?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The amlodipine and indapamide, yes. The ramipril, I take every day, except weekends, when I'm away and I forget."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks for being straight. How long on this combination? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About two years. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Conditions I should know?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, obviously. And gout."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you had any falls?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No falls."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take your numbers. Blood pressure 126 over 74, pulse 68, weight 90 kilos.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's where I'd like it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's good. Does it hold up on weekends? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hard to say. I only measure on weekdays. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Worth measuring on a weekend or two. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fair. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The ramipril is the one that matters for your kidneys and heart, so I'd like you to set a phone alarm for it, including weekends."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I do have a phone. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take it with breakfast, wherever you are. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Easy enough. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Since you're on a water tablet and the ramipril, I'd like to arrange blood tests for kidney function and salts."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This week. And I'd like an ECG, as it's been a while."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else about the tablets? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep a weekend blood pressure log, then, and bring it next time."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will do. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. That's everything. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thanks. ~"
  }
